Project Description:
Ammagariapalli Sand Reach, Godavari River (Lease area is 4.96 Ha. 
(Sand mining – 49600 m3/annum)
) by M/s. Telangana State Mineral Development Corporation Limited, Government of Telangana at Godavari River, Ammagariapalli Village, Aswapuram Mandal, Bhadradri Kothagudem District, Telangana State

Implementation of Advance Traffic Management System(ATMS) as per the orders of the Ministry of Road Transport & Highways, Government of India- through;
i.	Installation of Radio Frequency Towers, servo stabilizer, feeder panels and Transformers by construction of 6m x 6m cement concrete fencing boundary within the Right of Way at (07) locations (05 in Adilabad District and (02) in Nirmal District).
ii.	Installation of one (01) PTZ CCTV camera with basic analytics on a TMCS pole at every 1 km interval, with a foundation size of 0.6 m × 0.6 m, in the median of the existing main carriageway at (22) locations. (18 in Adilabad District and (04) in Nirmal District).
